      "side": 1,
      "message": "PermissionUtils is not an API (it\u0027s an @hide util class) so its tests should not be in CTS if possible. frameworks/libs/net/common/tests/unit/ would be a better place (although it\u0027s not strictly a unit test since it looks at actual permissions). Another reason is that libs/net classes are included in many modules, and the tests need to be in frameworks/libs/net/common/tests/unit/ so they are included in tests that contribute to code coverage calculations for each of these.",
      "revId": "543a5375f54e547a7bcee44b5ed5b25adb8064e1",
